### API #71 — Bulk Add Round Results

| Item | Value |
|------|-------|
| **Method** | `POST` |
| **URL** | `/api/college/bulk_add_round_results/:roundId` |

#### Request Body

```json
{
  "results": [
    { "application_id": "aaa-...", "result_status": "passed", "score": 85, "attended": true },
    { "application_id": "bbb-...", "result_status": "failed", "score": 32, "attended": true },
    { "application_id": "ccc-...", "result_status": "absent", "attended": false }
  ]
}
```

Max 200 results per request. Each item follows same validation as single add.

#### Response — Created/Skipped/Errors

```json
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Bulk add complete: 2 created, 1 skipped",
  "data": {
    "round_name": "Coding Test",
    "round_number": 1,
    "job_title": "Software Developer",
    "company_name": "TCS",
    "summary": { "total_requested": 3, "created": 2, "skipped": 1, "errors": 0 },
    "created": [
      { "result_id": "...", "application_id": "aaa-...", "student_name": "Rahul Sharma", "result_status": "passed" },
      { "result_id": "...", "application_id": "bbb-...", "student_name": "Priya Patel", "result_status": "failed" }
    ],
    "skipped": [
      { "application_id": "ccc-...", "student_name": "Amit Kumar", "reason": "Result already exists for this round" }
    ],
    "errors": []
  }
}
```

