## 3. Integration Guide

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    A[Job Postings] --> B[Job Rounds]
    A --> C[Applications]
    B --> D["Round Results ✨ NEW"]
    C --> D
    D --> E["Placement Results ❌ Future"]
```

### Data Flow
1. Job created → Rounds defined → Job published
2. Students apply → Application `shortlisted`
3. Admin creates **round results** for shortlisted students (this module)
4. Students marked `passed` → progress to next round
5. Final round passed → Application → `selected` → Placement result

### Prerequisite Relations
| To Create | Requires |
|-----------|----------|
| Round Result | Valid round + valid application for same job |
| Bulk Results | Same as above, per-item validation |

